// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/course/t27-compiler.t27 -- the t27 course on the compiler, how a .t27 file becomes Zig, Rust, C, Verilog and WebAssembly
; Source of truth for apps/website/scripts/course-from-spec.mjs (gHashTag/trinity), which reads
; it the way it reads specs/course/course.t27: the constant schema, every test block below, every
; widget in specs/widgets/gallery.t27, every lesson spec compiled clean, the Russian bundle named
; by specs/course/t27-compiler-ru.t27. It writes this course into src/lib/course.generated.ts
; (the page at #/t27-compiler) and a byte-identical copy of this file at
; public/learn/t27-compiler.t27. ASCII only (L3), English only (LANG-EN).

; WHAT THE COURSE IS: course 12 of specs/course/courses.t27, 27 lessons in 9 modules of 3: reading the
; text, shape and refusals, names and types, the cost estimate, the same answer from every backend, the
; output file, seals, trusting the compiler and down to the machine. A .t27 file is a spec with tests, and
; the compiler t27c turns it into code for several targets. gHashTag/t27 writes the rules of that
; pipeline, and the ways it has failed, as specs with numeric tests: specs/compiler, specs/verified,
; specs/t27mcp and specs/isa. Every widget runs the fn bodies of one of 18 of those specs compiled to
; WebAssembly (public/widgets/<id>/logic.js, held to its spec by scripts/widget-logic.mjs), vendored
; byte for byte from t27 master 90e797659.

; WHAT THE COURSE DOES NOT DO: it runs no compiler stage whole. The lexer and the parser of t27c scan
; structs, which WebAssembly cannot take, so the widgets run the byte tests, the precedence rule and the
; spec fns of the pieces around them, and the t27a assembler, which is a small front end of its own and
; lowers whole. Every number in a lesson is a constant or a recorded measurement of the lesson spec, or an
; answer of its compiled fns to inputs the reader sets. Lessons 16, 18, 21 and 23 quote lab accounts the
; specs record with a date; the page does not repeat the lab.

; WHY 27: 3 cubed lessons, the size of a TRI-27 word. Changing the shape changes the tests.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

module t27_compiler;

